CORE unix
main.c
--arch ppc64le --os linux --float-overflow-check --nan-check
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
On ppc64le, long double is IEEE binary128.  This covers the binary128 variant of
the library model, while test.desc covers the x86 80-bit extended variant on
x86 hosts.  Restricted to unix as --os linux requires a GCC-compatible
preprocessor.
